msgid "Mail"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"A mailbox of the child's own, in Thunderbird, with the account an adult "
"gives: Gmail, Outlook, iCloud or any provider. A Google account managed with "
"Family Link cannot sign in to it; the Gmail module is for one."
msgstr ""

msgid "Email address"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"The child's email address. Mail finds the provider's servers from it by "
"itself."
msgstr ""

msgid "Name"
msgstr ""

msgid "The name the child's messages are sent as."
msgstr ""

msgid "Incoming server"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"Only for a provider Mail cannot find by itself: its IMAP server, such as "
"imap.example.org."
msgstr ""

msgid "Outgoing server"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"Only for a provider Mail cannot find by itself: its SMTP server, such as "
"smtp.example.org."
msgstr ""

